commit 93af506c0477811059885141718f10d92d8c1420

C03: effect finals must not attribute the action to the person; wifi network questions must state the scan limit (NETWORK1295 residual)

llm: action_attributed_to_user vetoes second-person preterites («Ya apagaste el bluetooth») on verified effect finals; missing_scan_limit asks a wifi.status final to say it cannot scan or list available networks when the person asked for them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


